    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Mt. San Antonio College is a public community college in Walnut, California. It was founded in 1945 and offers more than 400 degree and certificate programs, 36 support programs, and more than 50 student clubs &amp; athletic programs.</p><p>Mt. San Antonio College is a Top 10 California Transfer College that attracts vast numbers of international students annually to its courses.</p><p>The college is a welcoming environment conducive to integrative learning. Students have easy access to the campus, access to a GoPass enabling free transportation via bus or rail and a scenic campus spanning 420 acres on the eastern edge of the Greater Los Angeles area. The plethora of multiple clubs, athletics opportunities, and student support services empower students to do more than just study.</p>",
      "image": null,
