    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Mt. San Antonio College students have various housing options available to accommodate their needs. The college provides convenient on-campus housing, allowing students to reside in a solid academic community with a conventional student experience. The campus offers residence halls equipped with furnished rooms, communal study areas, and laundry facilities. The surplus of nearby apartments and rental properties cater well to students who prefer to live off-campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student Life",
      "value": "<p>Athletics is a big part of student life in American colleges, and Mt. San Antonio College is no exception. The athletics teams have been nationally recognised, and regular game attendance is an excellent way to socialise with like-minded students.</p><p>Over 60 student clubs are available for students to pursue their hobbies and interests, with the Student Leadership and Advisor Awards ceremony acting as a great motivator for students to become an active part of campus life. Volunteering is encouraged to foster a sense of belonging to the community in addition to earning students recognition. Students feel valued at Mt. San Antonio College.</p>",
